  "html": "<p class=\"\">The hardware arm of the <strong class=\"\">Vulpes</strong> look — one palette, one glyph, generated out to seven device targets: Flipper Zero, OnionOS handhelds, the TD-H3 radio, Meshtastic nodes, a PortaPack, plus iPhone and iMac wallpapers. It takes the cyberpunk-neon Vulpes scheme from my editor and pushes it down onto the little screens, so my devices boot and theme in the same visual language as everything else I make.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"One look, many targets — the Vulpes glyph and palette generated across Flipper, OnionOS, TD-H3, Meshtastic, PortaPack, and the desktop\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/vulpes-devices/devices.png\" alt=\"One look, many targets — the Vulpes glyph and palette generated across Flipper, OnionOS, TD-H3, Meshtastic, PortaPack, and the desktop\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/vulpes-devices/devices.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/vulpes-devices/devices.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/vulpes-devices/devices.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/vulpes-devices/devices.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"One look, many targets — the Vulpes glyph and palette generated across Flipper, OnionOS, TD-H3, Meshtastic, PortaPack, and the desktop\" width=\"1524\" height=\"656\" style=\"--splay-rot:0.6deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1524×656\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">One look, many targets — the Vulpes glyph and palette generated across Flipper, OnionOS, TD-H3, Meshtastic, PortaPack, and the desktop</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"\">Everything derives from a single shared palette file — the same <code class=\"md-inline-code\">#e60067</code> magenta and <code class=\"md-inline-code\">#6eedf7</code> teal that run through the rest of the Vulpes system — so a new device target is mostly a matter of teaching the generator that platform's theme format. The scheme itself is open: it grew out of <a href=\"https://github.com/ejfox/vulpes.nvim\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://github.com/ejfox/vulpes.nvim\">vulpes.nvim<svg class=\"inline-block w-4 h-4 ml-1 opacity-50 dark:opacity-75 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity align-text-bottom\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385c.6.113.82-.258.82-.577c0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04c-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729c1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236c1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998c.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605c-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93c0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22c-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176c0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23c.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405c1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405c2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23c.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176c.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22c0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92c.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22c0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286c0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12\" class=\"\"></path></svg></a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/ejfox/vulpes-theme-lab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://github.com/ejfox/vulpes-theme-lab\">vulpes-theme-lab<svg class=\"inline-block w-4 h-4 ml-1 opacity-50 dark:opacity-75 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity align-text-bottom\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385c.6.113.82-.258.82-.577c0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04c-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729c1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236c1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998c.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605c-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93c0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22c-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176c0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23c.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405c1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405c2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23c.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176c.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22c0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92c.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22c0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286c0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12\" class=\"\"></path></svg></a> is a live builder for spinning up your own variant.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The Flipper Zero boot animation, generated straight from the palette — the fox, on a 128×64 monochrome screen\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/vulpes-devices/boot.gif\" alt=\"The Flipper Zero boot animation, generated straight from the palette — the fox, on a 128×64 monochrome screen\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/vulpes-devices/boot.gif 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/vulpes-devices/boot.gif 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/vulpes-devices/boot.gif 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/vulpes-devices/boot.gif 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"The Flipper Zero boot animation, generated straight from the palette — the fox, on a 128×64 monochrome screen\" style=\"--splay-rot:1.52deg;\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">The Flipper Zero boot animation, generated straight from the palette — the fox, on a 128×64 monochrome screen</figcaption>\n</figure>",
